            "user": "mappyburdy",
            "user_url": "https://api.openstreetmap.org/user/mappyburdy",
            "action": "commented",
            "text": "I think that technically pedestrians and cyclist are not permitted to use Ragsdale road.  It is the old road that was replaced by the larger bridge of Lake Acworth Drive/Hwy 92. the road is closed with barriers.  I think that the police simply just don't enforce it and people like to go on it for views of the lake without any car traffic on it.\nI will have to swing by and snap some pics",
